          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#fff8f2; --card:#fff; --muted:#7a5a47; --accent:#b76b3a; --accent-2:#ffd8b8; --leaf:#7fa58b; --radius:14px; --maxw:980px; --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial; }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{font-family:var(--sans); margin:0; color:#3e2f28; background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);}\\n    header{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:28px auto; padding:18px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:18px;}\\n    .logo{display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center}\\n    .brand{font-weight:700; color:var(--muted); font-size:18px}\\n    nav{margin-left:auto}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted); text-decoration:none; margin-left:14px; font-weight:600}\\n\\n    main{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:18px auto; padding:22px}\\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(183,107,58,0.08), rgba(127,165,139,0.05)); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:28px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 320px; gap:18px; align-items:center}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0; font-size:28px; color:#3a2b22}\\n    .hero p{margin:10px 0 0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.5}\\n    .hero .meta{margin-top:18px; display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center}\\n    .pill{background:var(--accent-2); color:var(--accent); padding:8px 12px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:700}\\n\\n    .card{background:var(--card); box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(62,47,40,0.06); border-radius:12px; padding:16px}\\n    .contact-form{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px}\\n    label{font-size:13px; color:var(--muted)}\\n    input,textarea,button,select{font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eee}\\n    textarea{min-height:110px; resize:vertical}\\n    button.primary{background:var(--accent); color:#fff; border:none; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:10px; font-weight:700}\\n    .small{font-size:13px; color:#8b6f60}\\n\\n    .grid-2{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px}\\n    .social-proof{display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center}\\n    .avatar{width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:12px; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f6efe9); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(127,165,139,0.08)}\\n    .quote{font-style:italic; color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .benefits{display:grid; gap:12px; margin-top:16px}\\n    .benefit{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start}\\n    .icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent-2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:800}\\n\\n    .process{margin-top:18px}\\n    .step{display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start}\\n    .step .num{width:36px;height:36;border-radius:10px;background:var(--leaf);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700}\\n\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    details{background:#fff; border-radius:10px; padding:12px; margin-bottom:10px}\\n\\n    .leadmagnet{display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; margin-top:18px}\\n    .leadmagnet input{flex:1}\\n\\n    footer{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:26px auto 80px; padding:14px; color:#8b6f60}\\n\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"logo\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <rect rx=\\\"12\\\" width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\" fill=\\\"#fff4ea\\\" />\\n        <path d=\\\"M12 30c6-8 12-8 18 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#7fa58b\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" />\\n        <circle cx=\\\"22\\\" cy=\\\"16\\\" r=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#b76b3a\\\" />\\n      </svg>\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">VIP Day + Ongoing Habits</div>\\n        <h1>Reach steady wellbeing with a single focused plan</h1>\\n        <p>I help busy people build practical habits and a gentle framework so small daily decisions reinforce resilience, energy, and calm. We focus on what you can keep for life, not quick fixes.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"small\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\"><button class=\\\"primary\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button></a>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"social-proof\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"avatar\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <svg width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 36 36\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n              <rect width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M18 12a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8z\\\" fill=\\\"#b76b3a\\\" />\\n            </svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">Serving clients in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • VIP Day & ongoing coaching</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <hr style=\\\"border:none;height:1px;background:#faf0ea;margin:12px 0\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\\"I finally have a simple daily rhythm that actually fits my life — no overwhelm.\\\"</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">— Satisfied client</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"benefits card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"benefits-heading\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"benefits-heading\\\">Outcomes I focus on</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"icon\\\">A</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Practical habits that stick</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Tiny routines built around your life so you move forward even on busy days.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"icon\\\">B</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Clear frameworks, gentle accountability</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">A simple model to make choices easier and keep momentum without pressure.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"icon\\\">C</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Sustainable energy & calm</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Shift small levers that compound into more reliable energy and less reactivity.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"process card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"process-heading\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"process-heading\\\">How a VIP Day moves you forward</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"num\\\">1</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Preparation</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">A focused intake to map routines, patterns, and priorities.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"num\\\">2</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Deep session</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">A full-day workshop to design your personalized plan and realistic habit ladder.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"num\\\">3</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Integration & follow-up</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Short check-ins and tools to make the new routines automatic over weeks.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-heading\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"faq-heading\\\">Common questions</h2>\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>What is included in a VIP Day?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">A structured preparation packet, a focused full-day session, a tailored plan you can implement immediately, and two follow-ups for accountability.</div>\\n      </details>\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Do you offer shorter coaching options?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">Yes — we design shorter paths after the VIP Day if ongoing support would help keep momentum.</div>\\n      </details>\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Are your methods evidence-informed?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">I use habit science and behavioral tools to design practical steps; these support lifestyle change without medical advice.</div>\\n      </details>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"leadmagnet card\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n        <h3>Free guide: The 5-Minute Evening Reset</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">A gentle routine that reduces next-day friction and helps you sleep and wake with intention. Instant PDF.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;\\\">\\n        <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email address\\\" aria-label=\\\"Email\\\" required />\\n        <button class=\\\"primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get the guide</button>\\n      </form>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2>Get in touch</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Prefer a quick chat? Call or email and we’ll find a time that fits your week.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-2\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h4>Contact details</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\"><strong>Phone:</strong> {{PHONE}}<br /><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Available by appointment in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and remotely.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div>\\n          <form class=\\\"contact-form\\\" action=\\\"/thank-you\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your full name\\\" required />\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" required />\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">How can I help?</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"A few sentences about your goals\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"budget\\\">Budget range (optional)</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"budget\\\" name=\\\"budget\\\">\\n              <option>Prefer to discuss</option>\\n              <option>$300–$800</option>\\n              <option>$800–$1,800</option>\\n              <option>$1,800+</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request a consult</button>\\n              <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700\\\">Book a VIP Day</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 22px\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">Carefully designed coaching — built for life</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Contact Page & Notes for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page (contact.html) for the earthy_warm template family and a short README to help you customize it.\\n\\nFiles provided:\\n- contact.html — full contact page with hero, social proof, benefits, process, FAQ, lead magnet, and call-to-action elements.\\n\\nDesign intent:\\n- Layout: warm, organic cards and rounded shapes to create approachable, premium presence.\\n- Voice: gentle_therapist — calm, supportive, outcome-focused copy.\\n- Program emphasis: VIP Day + habit-forward followup (programModel: vip_day).\\n\\nCustomizable placeholders (replace these across the file):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — your business or practice name\\n- {{TAGLINE}} — a short descriptive tagline\\n- {{PHONE}} — contact phone number\\n- {{EMAIL}} — contact email\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — primary button label (e.g., \\\"Book a VIP Day\\\")\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — primary CTA link (booking or lead magnet endpoint)\\n- {{COACH_NAME}} — coach name\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}} — credentials line (e.g., \\\"MSc, Wellness Coach\\\")\\n- {{CITY}} — city\\n- {{STATE}} — state\\n\\nEditing guidance:\\n- To change colors, update :root variables near the top of the page.\\n- Forms are intentionally minimal and post to placeholders; wire them to your form handler or backend.\\n- The lead magnet form submits to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — replace with your email service endpoint.\\n- The contact form currently posts to /thank-you — change to your preferred handler or add server-side processing.\\n\\nAccessibility & performance:\\n- Uses semantic sections, headings, and details for FAQ to improve keyboard navigation.\\n- No external assets or fonts: keeps load fast and private by design.\\n\\nNotes on ecosystem:\\n- This page assumes other templates exist (index.html, about.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html). Update nav labels if your site uses different slugs.\\n- Keep consistent brand tone across pages: this design favors small wins, practical habits, and gentle accountability.\\n\\nIf you need alternate layouts (mobile-first, image-heavy, or more clinical), request a revision and specify the layoutFamily and voiceFamily to tailor the page further.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
